  "body_text": "96 \r\n Real growth, designed to swing less than a few big bets. Dear Investor, \n\n &nbsp;\n\n Most people come to Quant Growth & Income (QG&I) to grow their money , not to chase a yield. \n\n &nbsp;\n\n That's exactly what QG&I does. Since June 3, this model portfolio is up 11.26% . Its benchmark, VYM, is now at -0.09%.*&nbsp;Real growth during a volatile time—not a parked yield. \n\n &nbsp;\n\n \r\n QG&I grows without the wild ride. Instead of a few expensive names that fall hard when the crowd turns, it holds up to 30 screened companies , so no single stock decides your year. Steady dividends cushion the drops while the portfolio compounds. \n\n &nbsp;\n\n Every stock earns its place first: a qualifying Dividend Safety Grade and a Quant Rating of Buy or Strong Buy. \n\n &nbsp;\n\n \r\nInvest for growth potential—without betting the year on a handful of stocks.\n\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n Subscribe to QG&amp;I \r\n — The Seeking Alpha Quant Team \n\n \r\n \r\n *Quant Growth & Income and Vanguard High Dividend Yield ETF (VYM) performances are as of September 16, 2026.&nbsp; \n\n &nbsp;\n\n \r\n Past performance is no guarantee of future results. Backtesting reflects historical relationships, not actual performance. QG&I is not an investment product run with real money and neither enables nor reflects actual trading activity. The above is offered for informational purposes only. Seeking Alpha does not take account of your objectives or financial situation and does not offer any personalized investment advice. Seeking Alpha is not a licensed securities dealer, broker, U.S. investment adviser, or investment bank. See more. \r\n\n Sent by Seeking Alpha, 244 5th Ave, Suite 2705, New York, NY 10001 \n\n Why are you receiving this? You subscribed to Seeking Alpha Marketing Updates.&nbsp; \n\n \r\n Unsubscribe from this list | Update your email preferences \n\n \r\n https://email-st.seekingalpha.com/oc/60ef41e776faba580a6caca0sahp9.7fnl/d39ee891